# Minimal SITL defaults for plain ArduPlane fixed-wing (--model plane).
#
# Upstream ArduPilot ships copter.parm/rover.parm/quadplane.parm under
# Tools/autotest/default_params/ but no plane.parm — plain fixed-wing has no
# equivalent file. Without one, a freshly-booted SITL instance has all-zero
# INS_ACC*OFFS/SCAL values, which ArduPilot's arming check reads as "never
# calibrated" (PreArm: "Arm: 3D Accel calibration needed") — confirmed
# 2026-09-15 against the official ArduPlane 4.7.1 release SITL binary, which
# never became armable within any realistic timeout without this file. These
# lines are copied verbatim from copter.parm/quadplane.parm's own comment
# ("we need small INS_ACC offsets so INS is recognised as being calibrated")
# — the same trick, just packaged for the model that upstream doesn't cover.
INS_ACCOFFS_X   0.001
INS_ACCOFFS_Y   0.001
INS_ACCOFFS_Z   0.001
INS_ACCSCAL_X   1.001
INS_ACCSCAL_Y   1.001
INS_ACCSCAL_Z   1.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_X   0.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_Y   0.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_Z   0.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_X   1.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_Y   1.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_Z   1.001
